        "answer": {
          "short": "$30\\text{ cm}^3$",
          "worked": "Since $10\\text{ mm}=1\\text{ cm}$, the dimensions are $2\\text{ cm}$, $3\\text{ cm}$ and $5\\text{ cm}$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}V&=lwh\\\\V&=2\\times3\\times5\\\\V&=30\\text{ cm}^3\\end{align*}$$",
